 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 505469,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "If it is 9:00 now, what time will it be in 43 hours?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>First, find 43 mod 12.</p>\n<p>Determine the remainder when 43 is divided by 12.</p>\n<p>43 ÷ 12 = 3 and a remainder. What is that remainder?</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"12 \\times 3 = 36\"></span></p>\n<p>Subtract 36 from 43.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"43 - 36 = 7\"></span></p>\n<p>The remainder is 7.</p>\n<p>The remainder is the solution to 43 mod 12.</p>\n<p>43 mod 12 ≡ 7</p>\n<p>Now, add 7 hours to 9:00.</p>\n<p>The time 7 hours after 9:00 is 4:00.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "4:00"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
